{{!
    @template tool_lp/related_competencies

    The competencies cross-referenced with a competency, as chips, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/related_competencies of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/related_competencies.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every core
    upgrade.

    Kept from core, because tool_lp/competencyactions and tool_lp/competencydialogue read them: the
    wrapper's data-region="relatedcompetencies" (replaced whole after an add or a removal); each delete
    link's data-action="deleterelation" and its id id-related-<competency id>, whose first eleven
    characters the handler strips to read the id, so the prefix is exact; each name's link with
    data-action="competency-dialogue" and data-id; and the JavaScript arming the dialogue. Kept for
    Behat: the link's text is the shortname, a space and the idnumber ("Cakes cakes"), and the
    region is what tool_lp's "competency page related competency" selector scopes to. The shortname
    keeps core's triple stash, the idnumber its double stash.
    Changed: the list is a row of chips (dim-comp-related) with the delete action inside its chip; the
    heading is an eyebrow; the empty case is a paragraph.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * showdeleterelatedaction - boolean
    * relatedcompetencies - array of id, shortname, idnumber

    Example context (json):
    {
        "showdeleterelatedaction": true,
        "relatedcompetencies": [
            {
                "id": 3,
                "shortname": "Listen actively",
                "idnumber": "COMM-2"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="relatedcompetencies" class="dim-comp-related">
    <p class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}crossreferencedcompetencies, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
    {{#relatedcompetencies.0}}
    <ul class="dim-comp-related__list">
        {{#relatedcompetencies}}
        <li class="dim-comp-related__item">
            <a href="#" data-action="competency-dialogue" data-id="{{id}}">{{{shortname}}}{{#idnumber}} {{idnumber}}{{/idnumber}}</a>
            {{#showdeleterelatedaction}}
            <a href="#" data-action="deleterelation" id="id-related-{{id}}">{{#pix}}t/delete, core, {{#str}}delete{{/str}}{{/pix}}</a>
            {{/showdeleterelatedaction}}
        </li>
        {{/relatedcompetencies}}
    </ul>
    {{/relatedcompetencies.0}}
    {{^relatedcompetencies}}
    <p class="dim-comp-related__empty">{{#str}}nocrossreferencedcompetencies, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
    {{/relatedcompetencies}}
</div>
{{#js}}
require(['tool_lp/competencydialogue'], function(Compdialogue) {
    Compdialogue.init();
});
{{/js}}
